# Rota — optional Hyprland keybind
#
# The daemon is started by rota.service (systemd --user), so it needs no
# exec-once here: a second instance would only refuse to start.
#
# Rota's trigger is the middle mouse button, held on the desktop. If you also
# want a keyboard trigger — the equivalent of Rovyl's Alt+Z — uncomment:
#
# bind = ALT, Z, exec, ~/.local/bin/rota toggle
#
# The overlay is a layer-shell surface, so it needs no window rules at all.
